{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-recognition-js","path":"/recognition","result":{"data":{"awards":{"edges":[{"node":{"frontmatter":{"title":"4th at IEEE SP CUP 2020","location":"ICASSP 2020, BARCELONA","tech":["openCV","anomaly","Time series analysis","LSTM","ICASSP '20"],"external":"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1H-4CH78pKu8Y2pv7kTB1-8ykH8xp_Xbg/view?usp=sharing","cover":{"childImageSharp":{"fluid":{"base64":"data:image/png;base64,","aspectRatio":1.9021739130434783,"src":"/static/7bff69cd953ef26e5e4ded96a076ba10/87dd3/sp_cup_2020.png","srcSet":"/static/7bff69cd953ef26e5e4ded96a076ba10/5418a/sp_cup_2020.png 175w,\n/static/7bff69cd953ef26e5e4ded96a076ba10/a8f78/sp_cup_2020.png 350w,\n/static/7bff69cd953ef26e5e4ded96a076ba10/87dd3/sp_cup_2020.png 700w,\n/static/7bff69cd953ef26e5e4ded96a076ba10/da960/sp_cup_2020.png 1050w,\n/static/7bff69cd953ef26e5e4ded96a076ba10/1b043/sp_cup_2020.png 1251w","srcWebp":"/static/7bff69cd953ef26e5e4ded96a076ba10/1a99d/sp_cup_2020.webp","srcSetWebp":"/static/7bff69cd953ef26e5e4ded96a076ba10/7b8d3/sp_cup_2020.webp 175w,\n/static/7bff69cd953ef26e5e4ded96a076ba10/696d0/sp_cup_2020.webp 350w,\n/static/7bff69cd953ef26e5e4ded96a076ba10/1a99d/sp_cup_2020.webp 700w,\n/static/7bff69cd953ef26e5e4ded96a076ba10/c41d1/sp_cup_2020.webp 1050w,\n/static/7bff69cd953ef26e5e4ded96a076ba10/98e8e/sp_cup_2020.webp 1251w","sizes":"(max-width: 700px) 100vw, 700px"}}}},"html":"<p>\"Unsupervised abnormality detection using intelligent and heterogeneous autonomous systems\" was the problem. Our objective was to detect anomalies in the behavior of ground and aerial systems in real time using embedded sensor data. We made every effort to accomplish that. My teammates and I finished 4th in the race. Many thanks to the organizers for putting this tournament together, and congrats to my teammates, without whom it would have been a difficult competition.</p>"}},{"node":{"frontmatter":{"title":"2nd at IEEE VIP CUP 2019","location":"ICIP 2019, TAIWAN","tech":["OpenCV","Keras","Python","ICIP '19"],"external":"https://ieeexplore.ieee.org/stamp/stamp.jsp?tp=&arnumber=9084324","cover":{"childImageSharp":{"fluid":{"base64":"data:image/jpeg;base64,","aspectRatio":1.7857142857142858,"src":"/static/b52b982df38781923c31871a5c71e452/cb825/cover_photo.jpg","srcSet":"/static/b52b982df38781923c31871a5c71e452/e95b4/cover_photo.jpg 175w,\n/static/b52b982df38781923c31871a5c71e452/6d118/cover_photo.jpg 350w,\n/static/b52b982df38781923c31871a5c71e452/cb825/cover_photo.jpg 700w,\n/static/b52b982df38781923c31871a5c71e452/92cc2/cover_photo.jpg 1050w,\n/static/b52b982df38781923c31871a5c71e452/3303c/cover_photo.jpg 1400w,\n/static/b52b982df38781923c31871a5c71e452/4c0ff/cover_photo.jpg 4190w","srcWebp":"/static/b52b982df38781923c31871a5c71e452/1a99d/cover_photo.webp","srcSetWebp":"/static/b52b982df38781923c31871a5c71e452/7b8d3/cover_photo.webp 175w,\n/static/b52b982df38781923c31871a5c71e452/696d0/cover_photo.webp 350w,\n/static/b52b982df38781923c31871a5c71e452/1a99d/cover_photo.webp 700w,\n/static/b52b982df38781923c31871a5c71e452/c41d1/cover_photo.webp 1050w,\n/static/b52b982df38781923c31871a5c71e452/ef3e8/cover_photo.webp 1400w,\n/static/b52b982df38781923c31871a5c71e452/fb703/cover_photo.webp 4190w","sizes":"(max-width: 700px) 100vw, 700px"}}}},"html":"<p>This competition's goal was to recognize human activities at home, work, and sports using a First Person View (FPV) camera. FPV activity detection is crucial for assisted living, activity tracking, and life journaling. Outlier motions (for example, induced by other people seen by the camera), motion blur, shifting illumination, and self-occlusion are the main obstacles to detecting FPV activity.</p>"}}]}},"pageContext":{}},"staticQueryHashes":["3115057458"],"slicesMap":{}}